    {
      "accounts": [
        {
          "docs": [
            "Permissionless. Rent goes to `acp_state.sponsor`, so the caller gains",
            "nothing and there is no race incentive. Doubles as a sweep for jobs whose",
            "terminal-transaction bundle failed to land."
          ],
          "name": "caller",
          "signer": true
        },
        {
          "docs": [
            "`deserialize_job` against `hook_state.acp_program`."
          ],
          "name": "job"
        },
        {
          "docs": [
            "All four are optional and individually skipped when already empty: a",
            "zero-budget job may have no escrow leg, and a job that never had a fund",
            "request has no kind-0 intent. Each is verified against its canonical",
            "seeds before anything is drained."
          ],
          "name": "fund_request_intent",
          "optional": true,
          "writable": true
        },
        {
          "name": "escrow_intent",
          "optional": true,
          "writable": true
        },
        {
          "docs": [
            "a typed account deserializes at entry, so a second call on an",
            "already-closed map would fail `AccountNotInitialized` and break the",
            "idempotence the blind sweep needs. The trade-off is that",
            "`FundRequestIntentId` no longer appears in the IDL, so off-chain readers",
            "decode it by hand: `job_key: Pubkey, has_live_intent: bool, bump: u8`",
            "after the 8-byte discriminator."
          ],
          "name": "fund_request_map",
          "optional": true,
          "writable": true
        },
